# Environment Variables for TrendTracker

## Optional: Real Twitter API Data
# TWITTER_BEARER_TOKEN=your_twitter_bearer_token_here

## How to get Twitter API access (optional):
# 1. Go to https://developer.twitter.com/
# 2. Create a developer account (may require approval)
# 3. Create a new app/project
# 4. Get your Bearer Token from the app settings
# 5. Uncomment and add it above

## Note:
# - GitHub data works without API keys (uses public API)
# - Reddit data works without API keys (uses public API)
# - Twitter works with curated realistic data (API key optional for real data)